{"pagination":{"maxPageableSet":"10000","numFound":1,"query":"name=Lapine&limit=10&title=Putting It Together","limit":10,"start":0},"items":{"mods":{"@version":"3.8","titleInfo":[{"title":"Putting it together ","subTitle":"how Stephen Sondheim and I created Sunday in the park with George "},{"@type":"alternative","title":"How Stephen Sondheim and I created Sunday in the park with George"}],"name":{"@usage":"primary","@type":"personal","namePart":"Lapine, James","role":[{"roleTerm":{"@type":"text","#text":"creator"}},{"roleTerm":{"@type":"text","#text":"author"}}]},"typeOfResource":"text","genre":[{"@authority":"rdacontent","#text":"text"},{"@authority":"aat","#text":"librettos (documents for music)"},{"@authority":"bisacsh","#text":"PERFORMING ARTS / Theater / Broadway & Musicals."},{"@authority":"bisacsh","#text":"PERFORMING ARTS / Theater / History & Criticism."},{"@authority":"fast","#text":"Musicals"},{"@authority":"fast","#text":"Librettos"},{"@authority":"lcgft","#text":"Musicals"},{"@authority":"lcgft","#text":"Librettos"},{"@authority":"rvmgf","#text":"Comédies musicales."},{"@authority":"rvmgf","#text":"Livrets (Musique)"}],"originInfo":[{"place":{"placeTerm":[{"@type":"code","@authority":"marccountry","#text":"nyu"},{"@type":"text","@authority":"marccountry","#text":"New York (State)"}]},"dateIssued":{"@encoding":"marc","#text":"2021"},"copyrightDate":{"@encoding":"marc","#text":"2021"},"issuance":"monographic","edition":"First edition."},{"@eventType":"publication","place":{"placeTerm":{"@type":"text","#text":"New York :"}},"agent":{"namePart":"Farrar, Straus and Giroux :","role":{"roleTerm":"publisher"}},"dateIssued":"2021."}],"language":{"languageTerm":[{"@type":"code","@authority":"iso639-2b","#text":"eng"},{"@type":"text","@authority":"iso639-2b","#text":"English"}]},"physicalDescription":[{"form":[{"@authority":"marcform","#text":"print"},{"@type":"media","@authority":"rdamedia","#text":"unmediated"},{"@type":"carrier","@authority":"rdacarrier","#text":"volume"}],"extent":"xv, 390 pages, 16 unnumbered pages of plates : illustrations (some color) ; 25 cm"},{"form":{"@type":"Illustrative content","#text":"illustration"}},{"form":{"@type":"Color content","#text":"polychrome"}}],"abstract":[{"@type":"Summary","#text":"\"A behind-the-scenes look at the making of the iconic Broadway musical Sunday in the Park with George\"-- Provided by publisher."},{"@type":"Summary","#text":"In 1982 Lapine, at the beginning of his career as a playwright and director, met Stephen Sondheim, nineteen years his senior and already a legendary Broadway composer and lyricist. Shortly thereafter, the two decided to write a musical inspired by Georges Seurat's nineteenth-century painting A Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte. Here Lapine chronicles the two-year odyssey of creating the iconic Broadway musical Sunday in the Park with George, accompanied by a treasure trove of personal photographs, sketches, script notes, and sheet music. The result is a deeply personal remembrance of their collaboration and friendship, and the highs and lows of a journey that resulted in a Pulitzer Prize-winning classic. -- adapted from jacket"}],"tableOfContents":{"@type":"Contents","#text":"Dramatis personae -- From Ohio to Sondheim -- Stephen Sondheim -- Sondheim goes off-Broadway -- Lapine goes Broadway -- The Booth Theatre -- Finale -- Sunday in the park with George."},"note":[{"@type":"statement of responsibility","#text":"James Lapine."},"Includes libretto on pages 259-383."],"subject":[{"geographicCode":{"@authority":"marcgac","#text":"n-us-ny"}},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":["Musicals","Production and direction"],"geographic":["New York (State)","New York"]},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Musicals","genre":"Librettos"},{"@authority":"rvm","topic":"Comédies musicales","genre":"Livrets"},{"@authority":"bisacsh","topic":"PERFORMING ARTS / Theater / Broadway & Musicals"},{"@authority":"bisacsh","topic":"PERFORMING ARTS / Theater / History 